{"slug":"Hecate_Strait","title":"Hecate Strait","cats":[],"headings":[{"id":"Nations","text":"Nations","level":2},{"id":"Details","text":"Details","level":2}],"html":"<p><b>Hecate Strait</b> is a North American map added to <a href=\"/OpenFront.io\" title=\"OpenFront\">OpenFront</a> in <a href=\"/Update_33.0\" title=\"Update 33.0\">Update 33.0</a> by <b>Liam Langford</b> — Strait located in British Columbia; full of fjords.</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><img src=\"/images/Hecate_Strait_map.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"551\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"2248\" data-file-height=\"1935\"><figcaption>The Hecate Strait map.</figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Nations\">Nations</h2></div>\n<p>The map features 28 named <a href=\"/Nations\" title=\"Nations\">nations</a>, including Old Massett Village, Skidegate, Cape Ball, Cumshewa, Dadens and Haina.</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Details\">Details</h2></div>\n<ul>\n<li><b>Categories:</b> North America</li>\n<li><b>Nations:</b> 28</li>\n<li><b>Public rotation frequency:</b> 4</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"See_also\">See also</h1></div>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/Maps\" title=\"Maps\">Maps</a></li><li><a href=\"/Update_33.0\" title=\"Update 33.0\">Update 33.0</a></li></ul>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">Map preview from the <a href=\"https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO/tree/main/map-generator/assets/maps/hecatestrait\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">OpenFront game files</a>.</div>","section":"Maps"}
